			<div class="content" id="post-content-4219980">
									

<p>As much as I'd like to claim credit for the idea that the coins form a self-referential loop, the initial premise was actually just two alternate universes (every tails was being shunted to one, and every heads was being shunted to another, until the two met at the end).</p>
<p>I find your interpretation that it's a self-referential loop to be amusing and clever enough to support it with a minor phrase on the final entry, though (edited in).</p>

